    {
      "id": 49284756,
      "commentKey": "hackernews-49284756",
      "parentId": 49274600,
      "author": "simjnd",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T12:07:04.000Z",
      "level": 1,
      "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49284756",
      "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49284756",
      "textRawHtml": "Deepseek V4 Flash 0731 was such a massive jump in capability for such a small model (and price), that I'm a bit disappointed by this release.<p>I keep my agents on tight leashes, using them very interactively for bouncing off ideas, architecture, and then writing code (especially prototyping) and Flash has been crushing everything I ever needed it to do.</p><p>Maybe my ambitions are too tame compared to people needing Fable / Sol grade models, but I'm probably staying on Flash and not moving on to Pro for the foreseeable future.</p>",
      "textZhHtml": "Deepseek V4 Flash 0731 对于如此小的模型（和价格）来说在功能上有了如此巨大的飞跃，以至于我对这个版本有点失望。<p>我对我的代理保持严格的控制，以交互方式使用它们来激发想法、架构，然后编写代码（尤其是原型设计），Flash 已经粉碎了我需要它做的一切。</p><p>也许我的野心也太大了与需要 Fable / Sol 级模型的人相比，我可能会继续使用 Flash，并且在可预见的未来不会转向 Pro。</p>",
      "translationStatus": "translated",
      "contentHash": "30856513f7b9322f86ca17cd0171bd4d6fdc92e9462f1d8c16f01f58e4ea94bc",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": 49287131,
          "commentKey": "hackernews-49287131",
          "parentId": 49284756,
          "author": "srigi",
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T15:06:08.000Z",
          "level": 2,
          "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49287131",
          "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49287131",
          "textRawHtml": "People when OW LLM looks good in benchmarks: benchmaxxxed<p>People when OW LLM looks mediocre in benchmarks: disappointed</p>",
          "textZhHtml": "当 OW LLM 在基准测试中看起来不错时，人们：benchmaxxxed<p>当 OW LLM 在基准测试中看起来平庸时，人们：失望</p>",
          "translationStatus": "translated",
          "contentHash": "18d6fa9311a2f07d2db6aae017afdd3dd742be640eac7df71b8369ff10ab3076",
