    {
      "id": 49276909,
      "commentKey": "hackernews-49276909",
      "parentId": 49274600,
      "author": "simonw",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-12T18:50:00.000Z",
      "level": 1,
      "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49276909",
      "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49276909",
      "textRawHtml": "Nice bicycle chain, the little basket with a fish didn't show up in the right place: <a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer#url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2F5d8474b8a9c1316c21ab5162b564f8ff\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer#url=ht...</a>",
      "textZhHtml": "漂亮的自行车链，装着鱼的小篮子没有出现在正确的位置：<a href=\"https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer#url=https%3A%2F%2Fgist.github.com%2Fsimonw%2F5d8474b8a9c1316c21ab5162b564f8ff\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tools.simonwillison.net/markdown-svg-renderer#url=ht...</a>",
      "translationStatus": "translated",
      "contentHash": "cac234dd4aa54ec2398709856277a6946421e9566f58c8737a1cf68acb60fb57",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": 49282521,
          "commentKey": "hackernews-49282521",
          "parentId": 49276909,
          "author": "jeswin",
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T06:49:13.000Z",
          "level": 2,
          "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282521",
          "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282521",
          "textRawHtml": "For a while now, I've found pelican rendering to be an unreliable metric for LLM ability - and most people know it. Yet, somehow it gets upvoted to the very top of every new model discussion.",
          "textZhHtml": "有一段时间，我发现鹈鹕渲染对于 LLM 能力来说是一个不可靠的指标 - 大多数人都知道这一点。然而，不知何故，它在每个新模型讨论中都被推到了首位。",
          "translationStatus": "translated",
          "contentHash": "2b1ff611d02bcb9872920957d34431d86864a4f05af8bc36074030b3034323d8",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": 49286131,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49286131",
              "parentId": 49282521,
              "author": "setsewerd",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T14:01:27.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49286131",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49286131",
              "textRawHtml": "As others commenters said, it's amusing. But also the person you're replying to is the guy who created the pelican test in the first place and I appreciate the whimsy he brings to the discussion.",
              "textZhHtml": "正如其他评论者所说，这很有趣。而且你要回复的人也是最初创建鹈鹕测试的人，我很欣赏他在讨论中带来的奇思妙想。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "6c1e5b3d9de7a2d542f897cffcb6f3ce063b73732dcc8599e86936a14bbe69b3",
              "children": [],
              "isDeleted": false
            },
            {
              "id": 49282531,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49282531",
              "parentId": 49282521,
              "author": "farfatched",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T06:52:01.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282531",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282531",
              "textRawHtml": "It's just a little fun.",
              "textZhHtml": "这只是一点乐趣。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "e519bd8324d57a3c77072005698cd1ddabcc1b00a6379cbbcea3669de9761b1f",
              "children": [],
              "isDeleted": false
            },
            {
              "id": 49283202,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49283202",
              "parentId": 49282521,
              "author": "zero0529",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T08:40:50.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283202",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283202",
              "textRawHtml": "Well it is just a bit of fun I think. However, I also think an AGI or an extremely capable model approaching AGI would be able to paint a pelican on a bicycle fairly easily. So in that way it is a good metric.",
              "textZhHtml": "嗯，我认为这只是一点乐趣。然而，我也认为 AGI 或接近 AGI 的极其强大的模型将能够相当容易地在自行车上画出鹈鹕。所以从这个角度来看，这是一个很好的指标。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "6bcb652dbe53c21bf6396e41010e57b357bddeac8470ad95e8ae236c3047b42a",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": 49285976,
                  "commentKey": "hackernews-49285976",
                  "parentId": 49283202,
                  "author": "rng-concern",
                  "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T13:52:23.000Z",
                  "level": 4,
                  "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49285976",
                  "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49285976",
                  "textRawHtml": "I agree it's fun, no argument there.<p>However, it's no longer a good metric, as \"drawing svg pelicans\" is now showing up too much in the training data, so is not proof of generalization.</p>",
                  "textZhHtml": "我同意这很有趣，没有争议。<p>但是，它不再是一个好的指标，因为“绘制 svg 鹈鹕”现在在训练数据中出现太多，所以不是泛化的证明。</p>",
                  "translationStatus": "translated",
                  "contentHash": "0f85d80df10ace586b6c84bc1d3cebc1ec0fa5f57edd8da2b87f82ef3dfffe55",
                  "children": [],
                  "isDeleted": false
                }
              ],
              "isDeleted": false
            },
            {
              "id": 49286713,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49286713",
              "parentId": 49282521,
              "author": "kanemcgrath",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T14:41:19.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49286713",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49286713",
              "textRawHtml": "Because of all the svg rendering stuff, I added a draw_svg tool to my harness and it has been really nice to get a quick mock-up of ui changes.  And conveniently, the new DeepSeek models are really good at knowing when to use it. So I do look at pelican rendering as a small metric of useful capability.",
              "textZhHtml": "由于所有 svg 渲染内容，我在我的工具中添加了一个 draw_svg 工具，并且能够快速获得 ui 更改的模型真是太好了。  方便的是，新的 DeepSeek 模型非常擅长知道何时使用它。因此，我确实将鹈鹕渲染视为有用功能的一个小指标。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "dcae00aa8d781fb2d3cb29d49da59eebbae88b1a80235cf97383f39f6c824190",
              "children": [],
              "isDeleted": false
            },
            {
              "id": 49284644,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49284644",
              "parentId": 49282521,
              "author": "amelius",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T11:55:17.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49284644",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49284644",
              "textRawHtml": "At this point I want to see some human-drawn pelicans on bicycles. I suspect the LLMs aren't doing all that bad.",
              "textZhHtml": "此时我想看到一些骑自行车的人力画鹈鹕。我怀疑法学硕士的表现并没有那么糟糕。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "87c9771ee3fad40ffee23a2fc8dbfeca91fcead58bb4218dfdb2e67ab48ef6ce",
              "children": [],
              "isDeleted": false
            },
            {
              "id": 49282809,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49282809",
