              "author": "schafberg",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T07:35:24.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282809",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49282809",
              "textRawHtml": "becuase most people don't care whether it's accurate, as long as it looks right and is funny...",
              "textZhHtml": "因为大多数人并不关心它是否准确，只要它看起来正确并且有趣......",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "baef01c1438ed51ae97b5f0ae7b2b78a5cd27211eb8047d4335664aa75e4d03b",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": 49283329,
