        {
          "id": 49287075,
          "commentKey": "hackernews-49287075",
          "parentId": 49276909,
          "author": "biztos",
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T15:01:13.000Z",
          "level": 2,
          "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49287075",
          "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49287075",
          "textRawHtml": "Basket? Fish? All I see is the model recursively running itself locally on an eye-pad, which for some reason beyond our understanding is obscuring the invisible fork.",
          "textZhHtml": "篮子？鱼？我所看到的只是模型在眼垫上本地递归运行，由于某种超出我们理解的原因，它遮盖了看不见的叉子。",
          "translationStatus": "translated",
          "contentHash": "3530f426e934662b6c66d937c54d3284d633ccd54344f1ffa23be4f4af67501b",
          "children": [],
          "isDeleted": false
        },
        {
          "id": 49280697,
          "commentKey": "hackernews-49280697",
          "parentId": 49276909,
          "author": "nhecker",
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T01:14:00.000Z",
          "level": 2,
          "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49280697",
          "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49280697",
          "textRawHtml": "On either side of the front wheel is a perfectly reasonable place to carry cargo. I think I'd have taken more issue with the spokes, or at least that's what stood out to me. The chain is indeed nice, however.",
          "textZhHtml": "前轮两侧都是非常合理的载货位置。我想我会对辐条有更多的疑问，或者至少这对我来说是最突出的。不过，这条链条确实不错。",
          "translationStatus": "translated",
          "contentHash": "67292ed2f5468464eae58ff1194cdc388f60c0b377b455f01adcd27ac1c548cc",
          "children": [],
          "isDeleted": false
        },
        {
          "id": 49279331,
          "commentKey": "hackernews-49279331",
          "parentId": 49276909,
          "author": "delduca",
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-12T22:14:27.000Z",
          "level": 2,
          "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49279331",
          "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49279331",
          "textRawHtml": "You don’t need the best model in 99% of cases…",
          "textZhHtml": "在 99% 的情况下你不需要最好的模型......",
          "translationStatus": "translated",
          "contentHash": "dd6f74e1949d866431b9b37b07d8c38b59d6ce9b8680b3994a29ca1183cbc6a4",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": 49279721,
              "commentKey": "hackernews-49279721",
              "parentId": 49279331,
              "author": "jug",
              "publishedAt": "2026-08-12T22:58:20.000Z",
              "level": 3,
              "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49279721",
              "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49279721",
              "textRawHtml": "This is true and is only becoming more important the more they improve. I am already moving to checking so they're at least somewhat following the status quo and otherwise prioritizing price and platform. I think this will be an emerging way of viewing AI in 2027 and the winner will probably be open models and China.",
              "textZhHtml": "这是事实，而且随着它们的改进，这一点只会变得更加重要。我已经开始检查，因此他们至少在某种程度上遵循现状，并优先考虑价格和平台。我认为这将是 2027 年看待人工智能的一种新兴方式，赢家可能是开放模型和中国。",
              "translationStatus": "translated",
              "contentHash": "f9c3083af0bfdfdf4ce8e8b68fe762167734fbe5e91c0d7fe594c8a92027b1c7",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": 49280454,
                  "commentKey": "hackernews-49280454",
                  "parentId": 49279721,
                  "author": "andy_ppp",
                  "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T00:40:36.000Z",
                  "level": 4,
                  "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49280454",
                  "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49280454",
                  "textRawHtml": "I think this likely plateaus and we all just get the smartest intelligence humans need running locally…",
                  "textZhHtml": "我认为这可能会趋于平稳，我们都只是获得了人类需要在本地运行的最聪明的智能......",
                  "translationStatus": "translated",
                  "contentHash": "47de3ab4dd3f6dbdec25e38d3e61d29a8a88b24d1001c394cf8f2a93548dc828",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": 49283968,
                      "commentKey": "hackernews-49283968",
                      "parentId": 49280454,
                      "author": "f6v",
                      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T10:33:05.000Z",
                      "level": 5,
                      "hnUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283968",
                      "sourceUrl": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283968",
                      "textRawHtml": "Don’t think it’s happening any time soon for most people. My Mac has stayed 32gb for many years now. I don’t think I’m moving into 128gb territory any time soon with all the price hikes.",
                      "textZhHtml": "对于大多数人来说，这种情况不会很快发生。我的 Mac 多年来一直保持 32GB。我认为随着价格的上涨，我不会很快进入 128GB 领域。",
                      "translationStatus": "translated",
